導航；目標未原生收全不造章ID。 原文、MID與字位不變；不拆題中人名。","work_id":"w-sanguozhi"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p010:m0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"韓","kind":"person","person_id":"sdf_7gn_zow","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"}],"source_position":{"provider":"Wikisource","revision_id":2376966,"first_line":75,"last_line":75,"raw_projection_ref":"source-evidence/sgz023-peiqian-ws2376966/projection.json","unit_key":"p010","source_layer":"pei_annotation"},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-023","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014","text":"魚豢曰：世稱君子之德其猶龍乎，蓋以其善變也。昔長安巿儈有劉仲始者，一爲巿吏所辱，乃感激，蹋其尺折之，遂行學問，經明行脩，流名海內。後以有道徵，不肯就，衆人歸其高。余以爲前世偶有此耳，而今徐、嚴復參之，若皆非似龍之志也，其何能至於此哉？李推至道，張工度主，韓見識異，黃能拔萃，各著根於石上，而垂陰乎千里，亦未爲易也。游翁慷慨，展布腹心，全軀保郡，見延帝王，又放陸生，優遊宴戲，亦一實也。梁、趙及裴，雖張、楊不足，至於檢己，老而益明，亦難能也。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"魚豢","kind":"person","person_id":"q2w_dba_ozq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"劉仲始","kind":"person","person_id":"jhy_pa4_8xt","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0093","start":93,"end":94,"surface":"徐","kind":"person","person_id":"d1c_f9d_yc9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"卷023明指諸葛亮傳的徐福；對讀固定卷035明徐庶元直及庶先名福，沿既有元直身份；絕非秦方士徐巿。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"嚴","kind":"person","person_id":"v2q_174_14w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整裴潛單元及具體上下文辨識；原字及見證層次保留。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-023-peiqian-ws2376966:p014:m0117","start":117,"end":118,"surface":"李"